e our own flaws  such a moment raises many questions how  do we make sense of this how do I move  onward and upward is this the bottom or  is there more to come  someone told me my problem so how do I  fix them how do I let this happen how  can it never happen again the world  breaks everyone and afterward many are  strong at the broken places but those  that will not break it kills the world  can show you the truth but no one can  force you to accept it Vince Lombardi  said this once a team like men must be  brought to its knees before it can rise  again  so yes hitting bottom is as brutal as it  sounds but the feeling after is one of  the most powerful perspectives in the  world if you shut up truth and bury it  on the ground it will but grow and  gather to itself such explosive power  that the day it bursts through it will  blow up everything in its way emile zola
 

